set address CORP ip-netmask 192.0.2.0/24
set address PCI ip-netmask 198.51.100.0/24
set vsys vsys2 rulebase security rules d from any to any source CORP destination PCI application any service any action deny
set vsys vsys1 rulebase security rules a from any to any source CORP destination any application any service any action allow
